# Lore Compendium

## Place-Delta
A walled hold above a drowned crypt. Its gate is kept by NPC-Gamma.

## NPC-Gamma
Gatekeeper of Place-Delta. Pronouns: they/them. Allegiance: the Hold.

## Item-Epsilon
A humming blade that glows near the dead.

## PC-Alpha
The party vanguard.

## PC-Beta
The party scout.

## PC-Kappa
The party caster.

## Place-Zeta
A minor site on the road to Place-Delta. Its keeper is NPC-Sigma.

## Place-Eta
A minor site on the road to Place-Delta. Its keeper is NPC-Tau.

## Place-Theta
A minor site on the road to Place-Delta. Its keeper is NPC-Upsilon.

## Place-Iota
A minor site on the road to Place-Delta. Its keeper is NPC-Phi.

## Place-Lambda
A minor site on the road to Place-Delta. Its keeper is NPC-Chi.

## Place-Mu
A minor site on the road to Place-Delta. Its keeper is NPC-Psi.

## Place-Nu
A minor site on the road to Place-Delta. Its keeper is NPC-Omega.

## Place-Xi
A minor site on the road to Place-Delta. Its keeper is NPC-Rho.

## NPC-Sigma
A minor figure of the Hold, known to carry Item-Sigma on patrol.

